# Real, per-deployment qcache config: which processes to attach to and which
# queries to cache is specific to each machine/deployment. Copy the checked-in
# config/*.example templates to these paths and fill in local values. The
# demo's own config lives under demo/config/ and is checked in as-is, since
# it is pinned to the reproducible docker-compose environment rather than any
# particular machine.
/config/qcache.conf
/config/cache.list
